// Dead (muted) notes: @dead renders an "×" notehead in notation and an "×" in
// place of the fret number in tab. Normal notes are unaffected; stems/beams stay.
part bl { clef bass tuning bass }
section A { c4 e@dead g e@dead | c8 c@dead g@dead c g@dead g c c@dead | }
form main { A }
score main { staff bl  tab bl }
